                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "17e61e36-4bb0-4a94-a4d2-49e96189ab22",
                                "sense_id": "8b8f471b-6619-30c5-87a1-d5b684ac682f",
                                "text": "Das Rechtsstaatsprinzip als solches ist expressis verbis nicht im GG erwâhnt. Laut Art. 23 Abs. 1 S. 1 GG wirkt die BRD zur Verwirklichung eines vereinten Europas bei der Entwicklung der EU mit, die u.a. demokratischen, „rechtsstaatlichen“, sozialen und föderativen Grundsätzen verpflichtet ist.",
                                "translation": "The principle of the rule of law as such is not mentioned expressis verbis in the Basic Law. According to Article 23 (1) sentence 1 of the Basic Law, the FRG cooperates in the development of the EU for the realization of a united Europe, which is committed, among other things, to democratic, “constitutional”, social and federal principles.",
                                "english": "The principle of the rule of law as such is not mentioned expressis verbis in the Basic Law. According to Article 23 (1) sentence 1 of the Basic Law, the FRG cooperates in the development of the EU for the realization of a united Europe, which is committed, among other things, to democratic, “constitutional”, social and federal principles."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
